@startuml
title А2. СМП — контейнеры и связи
top to bottom direction
scale max 1600*900
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 24
skinparam ranksep 30
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

actor "Terminal" as term
actor "Мерчант" as merchant
actor "Пользователь" as user

rectangle "СМП / сервисы docker-compose.yaml" {
  together {
    component "Terminal Simulator\n:8085" as tsim
    component "Merchant + Acquirer\n:8084" as msim
    component "Dashboard\nReact :3000" as dash
  }
  together {
    component "Gateway\n:8080\nвалидация, лимиты" as gw
    component "Switch\n:8082\nBIN routing" as sw
    component "Authorization\n:8083\nправила, reserve/rollback" as auth
    component "Card Management\n:8081\nкарты, резервы, outbox" as cms
    component "BIN Lookup\n:8096" as bin
  }
  together {
    database "PostgreSQL\n:5432" as db
    queue "RabbitMQ\nAMQP :5672\nUI :15672" as mq
    component "Transaction Logger\n:8088\nREST + WebSocket" as log
    component "Notification Service\n:8097" as notif
    component "Autoscaler\noptional profile" as autoscaler
  }
}

term --> gw : HTTP POST /api/transactions
merchant --> gw : HTTP POST /api/transactions
tsim --> gw : HTTP REST
msim --> gw : HTTP REST
user --> dash : HTTP(S)
gw --> sw : HTTP sync
gw --> cms : HTTP sync\n/api/cards/**
gw --> log : HTTP sync\ntransactions/dashboard API
gw --> tsim : HTTP sync\n/api/simulator/terminal/**
gw --> msim : HTTP sync\n/api/simulator/merchant/**
sw --> auth : HTTP sync authorize / rollback
sw --> msim : HTTP sync\nacquiring fee lookup
auth --> bin : HTTP GET /api/bin/{bin}\nsync, best-effort
auth --> cms : HTTP sync GET / reserve / rollback
auth --> db : JDBC/JPA limit_usage, RRN block
cms --> db : JDBC/JPA cards, reservations, outbox
sw ..> mq : AMQP async\nsmp.transactions / transaction.log
mq ..> log : AMQP async\ntransaction-log
cms ..> mq : AMQP async\nsmp.card-events / card.*
mq ..> notif : AMQP async\ncard-notifications
log --> db : JDBC/JPA transaction records
notif --> db : JDBC/JPA notifications
dash --> gw : REST
dash --> log : REST + WebSocket

note right of sw
Switch uses a local BIN → issuerId map;
it does not call BIN Lookup.
Source: services/switch/.../RoutingService.java.
end note
note bottom of mq
Async topology and failure mechanics: 05-rabbitmq-topology.puml.
Switch has CORRELATED confirm mode configured, but LoggerClient does not
explicitly wait for CorrelationData. See RouteService.java and LoggerClient.java.
Autoscaler is optional; Prometheus/Grafana/Loki are additional observability
infrastructure, outside the 11 named service containers listed here.
end note
@enduml
